SUMMARY:31st Annual Magic Christmas in Lights at Bellingrath
DESCRIPTION:Bellingrath Gardens strings its grounds with thousands of ligh
 ts each winter\, and this is the 31st season of the walk-through show in 
 Theodore. Evening hours run from 5 PM to 9 PM\, and the home tour stays o
 pen until 8:30 PM. The show is closed on November 25 and 26\, December 25
  and January 1. Ticket prices are not yet published\, so check the garden
